<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Telemig nine-month earnings rise.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Telemig nine-month earnings rise.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Telemig, unit of federally owned Telebras serving Minas Gerais state, sent the following statement to the stock exchanges on its results for the January-to-September period.</p>
<p>				Jan-Sept 1996	Jan-Sept 1995</p>
<p>    Shr profit		  7.43 reais	    1.93 reais</p>
<p>    Net profit		 174.267 mln	   42.958 mln</p>
<p>    Net oper rev	     764.792 mln	  464.392 mln</p>
<p>    Net worth		  1.722 bln		   N/A</p>
<p>Note: All figures in Brazilian reais. Shr profit per 1,000 stocks.</p>
<p>-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom, 55-11-2485412</p>
</text>
